{"id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-asymptotic-prob.md","title":"标号结构的均匀概率与渐近概率","display":"df-asymptotic-prob — 标号结构的均匀概率与渐近概率","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","aliases":["29-df-asymptotic-prob"],"display":"df-asymptotic-prob — 标号结构的均匀概率与渐近概率","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-fo-language]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"§6.5, pp.107–109, DjVu scans 122–124","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-asymptotic-prob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-asymptotic-prob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-asymptotic-prob — 标号结构的均匀概率与渐近概率"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff5b73e2fc5d5965\" href=\"?note=ff5b73e2fc5d5965\" title=\"29-df-fo-language\">29-df-fo-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§6.5, pp.107–109, DjVu scans 122–124"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> 为固定有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为非空有限结构类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span>，满足关系见所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-结构的元语言性质类；概率仅在下式有限标号样本空间上计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_\\tau\">\\(\\mu_\\tau\\)</span> 是定义域由收敛条件确定的元语言部分算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid |A|=[n]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid |A|=[n]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\frac{|S\\cap\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|}{|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|},\\qquad\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\frac{|S\\cap\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|}{|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|},\\qquad\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_n(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq N\\;|\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)-p|&lt;\\epsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq N\\;|\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)-p|&lt;\\epsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_\\tau(S)=p\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\land p=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_\\tau(S)=p\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\land p=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_\\tau(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_\\tau(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §6.5，印刷页 107–109，扫描页 122–124。这里的“标号”只用于枚举有限样本，并未把序关系加入公式词汇。有限词汇和非空域保证样本空间有限且非空；极限若存在则唯一。此前在 Hypothesis 中预先假定概率收敛，不能用于证明零一律的收敛结论，现改成有精确定义域的部分函数。记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mu_n(\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mu(\\varphi)\\)</span> 保留为固定词汇下的简写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-language","status":"resolved","id":"ff5b73e2fc5d5965","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid |A|=[n]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)\\coloneqq\\frac{|S\\cap\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|}{|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau]|},\\qquad\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_n(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon>0\\;\\exists N\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq N\\;|\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S)-p|<\\epsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_\\tau(S)=p\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ S\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu_\\tau)\\land p=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mu_\\tau(\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models\\varphi\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_n(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":2170,"backlinks":[{"id":"4998dc488f84d2d6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbf2193c8d68c9be","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb492e1d42d41f7a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-sentence]]；$\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\phi)$ 是 [[29-df-asymptotic-prob]] 中域为 $\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ 的全部标号 $\\tau$ 结构上的均匀概率，$n\\geq1$。每个关系表条目独立且概率为 $1/2$。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-asymptotic-prob]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae","ff5b73e2fc5d5965","3ee556c64b16809b"]}